 R←Test_Misc_006(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;C;path;pkgCfgFilename;cfg;apiFolder;noOf
⍝ Check the public interface
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 C←##.CiderConfig
 path←C.HOME,'/',C.CIDER.distributionFolder
 pkgCfgFilename←C.HOME,'/apl-package.json'
 cfg←⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊢⊃⎕NGET pkgCfgFilename
 apiFolder←C.HOME,'/',cfg.source,'/',cfg.api
 →T.PassesIf ⎕NEXISTS apiFolder
 noOf←≢⊃⎕NINFO⍠('Wildcard' 1)⊢apiFolder,'/*'
 →T.PassesIf noOf=≢##.CommTools.Public

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
